, just like the customer ordered. Adjust your timing based on steak thickness, and try not to flip it too many times. Nobody likes an over-flipped steak.<br><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br>Jiggly Fresh Meat: These steaks are as fresh as they come, with that perfect jiggly softness.<br><br>Sizzling Sounds: The more surface area you’ve got touching the pan, the louder the sizzle. And yes, the front and back sides grill differently, just like in real life.<br><br>Helpful Tools: We’ve got side cameras so you can peek at the edges, and sensors to check how done it is. Who knew grilling steak could be so high-tech?<br><br>More Than Meat?: As a little bonus, you can also grill pancakes. Because why not?<br><br><i>Single-player Only:</i> We figured you'd want some peaceful, solo steak-grilling time, so this one’s just for you. No distractions, just you and your steak.", "short_description": "This is a game for anyone who just wants to grill a steak. That’s it. You grill steaks. We’ve really focused on getting that jiggly meat texture just right.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303530/header.jpg?t=1732847435", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303530/3c8ddd1f71d45cc418801e456992abb98002bb9e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1732847435", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303530/3c8ddd1f71d45cc418801e456992abb98002bb9e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1732847435", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit versions)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7500 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce GTX 650 or AMD Radeon HD 7750<br></li><l